"energy.com/our-products/support/>`__ 了解 8 号端口的位置。只需连接 GND、UART TX 和 UART "
"RX。请参阅下图："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:38
#: d27009b2d473479a81d2c9218724ecf3
msgid "Parameter Configuration"
msgstr "参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:40
#: b52eafffb36943ea8a49d5de06229692
msgid ""
"Enable the fuel cell driver by setting :ref:`GEN_TYPE <GEN_TYPE>` to 2."
msgstr "将 :ref:`GEN_TYPE <GEN_TYPE>` 设置为 2 以启用燃料电池驱动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:42
#: 33de420b1fda4cedaa771bd741128a87
msgid ""
"Fuel cell telemetry is transmitted over serial.  The appropriate serial port"
" needs to be configured to receive fuel cell data.  Set the "
":ref:`SERIALX_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` parameter to 30 for generator."
msgstr ""
"燃料电池数传通过串口传输。需要配置相应串口以接收燃料电池数据。将 :ref:`SERIALX_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` "
"参数设置为 30（发电机）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:44
#: 08ec932de78e498bb02c46c65406fb0f
msgid ""
"The generator library utilises the battery monitor mavlink messages to "
"display fuel cell telemetry on the ground station.  Two battery monitor "
"instances are required for one fuel cell.  One for the fuel tank and another"
" for the battery.  Set :ref:`BATTX_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` parameter to 17 "
"for the fuel cells electrical data.  Set another :ref:`BATTX_MONITOR "
"<BATT_MONITOR>` parameter to 18 for the hydrogen tank telemetry."
msgstr ""
"发电机库利用电池监测 MAVLink 消息在地面站显示燃料电池数传。一个燃料电池需要两个电池监测实例：一个用于燃料罐，另一个用于电池。将 "
":ref:`BATTX_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` 参数设置为 17 以获取燃料电池电气数据；将另一个 "
":ref:`BATTX_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` 参数设置为 18 以获取氢气罐数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:46
#: 1785c473fbea4e0eb7386a43e7e0385a
msgid ""
"This fuel cell unit reports tank percentage remaining.  As such, the "
"following parameter must be set for the tank battery monitor:"
msgstr "此燃料电池单元报告剩余罐量百分比。因此，必须为罐电池监测设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:48
#: af6dd6974c104f138e526c76f6d30ffc
msgid ""
":ref:`BATTX_CAPACITY <BATT_CAPACITY>` = 100 must be set to give a sensible "
"readout of a percentage on the GCS."
msgstr ":ref:`BATTX_CAPACITY <BATT_CAPACITY>` = 100，以在地面站获得有意义的百分比读数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:50
#: a1fdf13284aa4ef88f7c858141939f8c
msgid ""
"Tank capacity related failsafes can be set using :ref:`BATTX_LOW_MAH "
"<BATT_LOW_MAH>`, :ref:`BATTX_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>`, :ref:`BATTX_ARM_MAH "
"<BATT_ARM_MAH>`."
msgstr ""
"可使用 :ref:`BATTX_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>`、:ref:`BATTX_CRT_MAH "
"<BATT_CRT_MAH>`、:ref:`BATTX_ARM_MAH <BATT_ARM_MAH>` 设置与罐容量相关的失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:52
#: 5db0bd9c3258470f9e144d8d9f4b930d
msgid ""
"Reboot the autopilot after setting the parameters for the settings to take "
"effect."
msgstr "设置参数后重启飞控以使设置生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:54
#: 4c657c6ecfda43409f28fbfeb5315de3
msgid ""
"Normal battery monitor failsafes for battery capacity and battery voltage "
"can be set on the monitor instance designated as 'Generator-Elec'.  However,"
" keep in mind that the battery capacity on these units is small for the size"
" of vehicle required to lift them.  Hence, if the battery voltage or "
"capacity remaining failsafes are triggered there is not a lot of flight time"
" left and you should land immediately."
msgstr ""
"正常电池监测失控保护（电量和电压）可在指定为「Generator-"
"Elec」的监测实例上设置。但请注意，这些设备的电池容量对于需要提升它们的飞行器来说较小。因此，如果触发了电池电压或剩余量失控保护，剩余飞行时间已不多，应立即降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:57
#: 72ecf621b3d74d7d8b3187a76e64f081
msgid ""
"In this instance, ignore the units of the fuel tank capacity parameter.  The"
" tank capacity is only reported as a percentage.  As such values should be "
"entered in the range from 1 to 100."
msgstr "在此情况下，忽略燃料罐容量参数的单位。罐容量仅以百分比报告，因此值应在 1 到 100 范围内输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:60
#: f142a8dbff5647e4a7d470364ed67dc3
msgid ""
"Voltage data is reported for the battery.  Because the fuel cell is "
"constantly charging the battery, you will not see a significant change in "
"battery voltage.  Only once the fuel cell has used all of its hydrogen and "
"you are using the battery exclusively will you see large changes in voltage."
msgstr ""
"电压数据针对电池报告。由于燃料电池持续为电池充电，电池电压不会有明显变化。只有当燃料电池耗尽氢气、完全依靠电池供电时，才会看到电压大幅变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:63
#: 185dcc3d1cc64c17b084a6bb96e72b60
msgid ""
"The current reported on the GCS is the battery current.  What is unusual if "
"you are used to using a normal battery monitor, is that the current will go "
"negative.  A negative current indicates that the battery is charging.  A "
"positive current will indicate that the battery is being used to supplement "
"the fuel cell's power output.  Similarly you will notice that the battery "
"remaining percentage will increase again as the battery is recharged."
msgstr ""
"地面站上报告的电流是电池电流。如果您习惯使用普通电池监测，会注意到电流会变为负值。负电流表示电池正在充电。正电流表示电池正在补充燃料电池的输出功率。同样，随着电池被充电，电池剩余百分比也会再次增加。"

